## Inbox & Outbox

`inbox/` and `outbox/` are workspace folders for directed messages between agents or for drafts awaiting review. **Disambiguation:** When {{USER_NAME}} says "inbox" {{USER_PRONOUN_SUBJECT}} usually mean{{USER_VERB_S}} the **Gmail inbox** (email). The `{{MINERU_HOME}}/inbox/` folder is for cross-agent notes. Listen for context clues - "check my inbox" = email; "leave a note in the inbox" or "write to inbox" = the workspace inbox folder.

