## Session Reset

Automatic daily reset is **disabled**. {{USER_NAME}} manually runs `/new` when ready to reset. The daemon warns once each as context crosses 30%, 50%, and 70% of the 1M window (Landline `CONTEXT_WARN_THRESHOLDS`). The 1 AM consolidation job reads CC JSONL files directly for session persistence.

